1. Student Accounts in Admin ✅

The list displays registered students, including their Student IDs, names, emails, and account creation dates. Grade Level and Section are also part of the student data we're working with.



2. Clickable Student IDs and Profiles

Clicking a Student ID should open the student's complete personal information. The Admin and Student Profile pages must use the same database record.



3. Accounting Workflow

Payment choices, applicable fees, payment processing, and each student's complete financial ledger—including charges, payments, and running balances.



4. Registrar Workflow

Processing academic-record and document requests, updating statuses, and tracking request completion.



5. Database-connected queue processing

Accounting and Registrar actions should persist in MySQL and work with the existing ticket and queue system—not rely on browser-only storage.